Package: armatos-release
Version: 2779.1
Section: admin
Priority: important
Architecture: all
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Armatos Linux identity: os-release, issue, lsb-release, motd
 Names the system Armatos Linux. Ubuntu's own files are diverted with
 dpkg-divert, so Ubuntu updates can't overwrite them, and are restored if
 this package is removed. Also quiets Ubuntu's help, news and Pro messages
 at login. lsb_release still reports Ubuntu, for compatibility.
 .
 Also opens the horreum, Armatos's own APT repository, and carries the key
 it is signed with, so Armatos packages arrive as ordinary updates.
